    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "False.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x^{\\frac13})^2&=x^{\\frac13\\times2}\\\\(x^{\\frac13})^2&=x^{\\frac23}.\\end{align*}$$The printed right side is $x^{\\frac13}$ because $\\frac26=\\frac13$. At $x=8$, the sides are $4$ and $2$, so the statement is false.",
